fs-upgrade-lcarbine-charge-speed = Capacitor Boost
fs-upgrade-lcarbine-charge-speed-desc = Self-recharge rate ×2 per level (×8 at max). More shots between engagements.

fs-upgrade-lcarbine-multishot = Split Emitter
fs-upgrade-lcarbine-multishot-desc = Chance per shot to fire 1-3 additional bolts, fanned within the spread cone so they don't overlap. Stacks with Homing Bolts.

fs-upgrade-lcarbine-fire-rate = Overclocked Cycling
fs-upgrade-lcarbine-fire-rate-desc = Tuned capacitor discharge increases fire rate by 0.5/level.

fs-upgrade-lcarbine-damage = Amplified Emitter
fs-upgrade-lcarbine-damage-desc = Higher energy output increases damage by 20% per level.

fs-upgrade-lcarbine-overload = Overload Round
fs-upgrade-lcarbine-overload-desc = Every 5th/4th/3rd shot is automatically supercharged, dealing double damage.

fs-upgrade-lcarbine-homing = Homing Bolts
fs-upgrade-lcarbine-homing-desc = Bolts steer toward the nearest enemy in flight. Higher levels turn faster and tighter.

fs-upgrade-lecter-damage = Heavy Rounds
fs-upgrade-lecter-damage-desc = Higher-grain ammunition increases damage dealt by 15% per level.

fs-upgrade-lecter-recoil = Reduced Recoil
fs-upgrade-lecter-recoil-desc = Muzzle compensator tightens spread by 0.5° per level. More rounds on target.

fs-upgrade-lecter-ap = AP Rounds
fs-upgrade-lecter-ap-desc = Armor-piercing ammunition. Rounds bypass enemy armor entirely.

fs-upgrade-lecter-reload = Speed Loader
fs-upgrade-lecter-reload-desc = Faster magazine change per level.

fs-upgrade-lecter-overkill = Overkill
fs-upgrade-lecter-overkill-desc = Excess damage on a killing shot transfers to the nearest enemy. Higher levels increase transfer range.

fs-upgrade-lecter-execution = Execution
fs-upgrade-lecter-execution-desc = Deals 5× damage against targets below 25% HP. Finish them.

fs-upgrade-lecter-penetrator = Penetrator
fs-upgrade-lecter-penetrator-desc = Shots pierce enemies. Each level adds a target, max 4; damage halves per hit.

fs-upgrade-pulse-damage = Overloaded Cell
fs-upgrade-pulse-damage-desc = Higher energy output increases damage dealt by 15% per level.

fs-upgrade-pulse-fire-rate = Rapid Pulse
fs-upgrade-pulse-fire-rate-desc = Tuned cycling increases fire rate by 0.3/level.
fs-upgrade-pulse-fullAuto = Full Auto
fs-upgrade-pulse-fullAuto-desc = Unlocks full-auto fire mode.

fs-upgrade-pulse-charge-speed = Capacitor Boost
fs-upgrade-pulse-charge-speed-desc = Self-recharge rate ×2 per level (×8 at max).

fs-upgrade-pulse-cascade = Pulse Cascade
fs-upgrade-pulse-cascade-desc = Kills trigger 3 explosions at the kill site dealing 50% of the killing shot's damage. Can chain.

fs-upgrade-pulse-penetrator = Penetrator
fs-upgrade-pulse-penetrator-desc = Shots pierce enemies. Each level adds a target, max 4; damage halves per hit.

fs-upgrade-mosin-marksmans-rhythm = Marksman's Rhythm
fs-upgrade-mosin-marksmans-rhythm-desc = Each consecutive hit builds a stack. Each stack adds 10% damage. Miss a shot and lose all stacks. Stacks decay after 10 seconds of not firing.

fs-upgrade-mosin-full-auto = Custom Receiver
fs-upgrade-mosin-full-auto-desc = Fully automatic conversion. Enables full-auto and doubles fire rate.

fs-upgrade-mosin-lucky-shot = Lucky Shot
fs-upgrade-mosin-lucky-shot-desc = Adds a 15% critical hit chance per level. Maxes out at 100%.

fs-upgrade-mosin-damage = Heavy Grain
fs-upgrade-mosin-damage-desc = Higher-grain ammunition increases damage by 50% per level.

fs-upgrade-mosin-skull-breaker = Skull Breaker
fs-upgrade-mosin-skull-breaker-desc = Critical hits deal 50% additional damage per level.

fs-upgrade-mosin-extended-mag = Extended Magazine
fs-upgrade-mosin-extended-mag-desc = Extended internal magazine adds 5 rounds per level.

fs-upgrade-mosin-fast-hands = Fast Hands
fs-upgrade-mosin-fast-hands-desc = Decreases reload time by 25% per level.

fs-upgrade-mosin-pierce = Piercing Rounds
fs-upgrade-mosin-pierce-desc = Armor-piercing rounds pierce enemies. Each level adds a target; damage halves per hit.

fs-upgrade-mosin-stripper-clip = Stripper Clip
fs-upgrade-mosin-stripper-clip-desc = Spawns a 5-round stripper clip per purchase per level, letting you reload multiple rounds at once instead of one at a time.

fs-upgrade-estoc-full-auto = Custom Receiver
fs-upgrade-estoc-full-auto-desc = Fully automatic conversion. Removes burst mode.

fs-upgrade-estoc-damage = Match Grade Ammo
fs-upgrade-estoc-damage-desc = Precision-loaded ammunition increases damage by 35% per level.

fs-upgrade-estoc-extended-mag = Extended Magazine
fs-upgrade-estoc-extended-mag-desc = Extended magazine adds 10 rounds per level.

fs-upgrade-estoc-hv-rounds = HV Rounds
fs-upgrade-estoc-hv-rounds-desc = High-velocity ammunition increases projectile speed by 50% per level.

fs-upgrade-estoc-fast-hands = Fast Hands
fs-upgrade-estoc-fast-hands-desc = Decreases reload time by 10% per level.

fs-upgrade-estoc-lucky-shot = Lucky Shot
fs-upgrade-estoc-lucky-shot-desc = Adds a 5% critical hit chance per level.

fs-upgrade-estoc-pierce = Piercing Rounds
fs-upgrade-estoc-pierce-desc = Armor-piercing rounds pierce enemies. Each level adds a target; damage halves per hit.

fs-upgrade-hristov-damage = AP Rounds
fs-upgrade-hristov-damage-desc = Armor-piercing ammunition increases damage by 190% per level.

fs-upgrade-hristov-skull-breaker = Skull Breaker
fs-upgrade-hristov-skull-breaker-desc = Critical hits deal 100% bonus damage.

fs-upgrade-hristov-fully-loaded = Fully Loaded
fs-upgrade-hristov-fully-loaded-desc = Extended internal magazine adds 1 round per level.

fs-upgrade-hristov-pierce = Piercing Rounds
fs-upgrade-hristov-pierce-desc = Your shots pierce enemies. Each level adds a target; damage halves per hit.

fs-upgrade-hristov-hv-rounds = HV Rounds
fs-upgrade-hristov-hv-rounds-desc = High-velocity casings increase projectile speed by 100% per level.

fs-upgrade-null-field-capacity = Extra Charge
fs-upgrade-null-field-capacity-desc = Carry one additional Null Field charge.

fs-upgrade-damage-beacon-capacity = Extra Charge
fs-upgrade-damage-beacon-capacity-desc = Carry one additional Damage Beacon charge.

fs-upgrade-landmine-capacity = Extra Mines
fs-upgrade-landmine-capacity-desc = Carry one additional mine per level.

fs-upgrade-landmine-damage = Dense Filler
fs-upgrade-landmine-damage-desc = Each level adds a quarter of the mine's base blast damage.

fs-upgrade-landmine-detonations = Reusable Core
fs-upgrade-landmine-detonations-desc = The mine re-arms itself after going off, one extra time per level.

fs-upgrade-landmine-regen = Field Fabricator
fs-upgrade-landmine-regen-desc = Restock one more mine each wave.

fs-upgrade-landmine-he = High Explosive
fs-upgrade-landmine-he-desc = Widens the blast to cover a three by three area.

fs-upgrade-ammo-box-uses = Deeper Stock
fs-upgrade-ammo-box-uses-desc = One extra resupply use per level.

fs-upgrade-ammo-box-speed = Quick Release
fs-upgrade-ammo-box-speed-desc = Cuts the time it takes to draw a resupply.

fs-upgrade-medi-drone-capacity = Spare Drone
fs-upgrade-medi-drone-capacity-desc = Carry one more Medi-Drone for when the first burns out.

fs-upgrade-l6-fire-rate = Shredder
fs-upgrade-l6-fire-rate-desc = Optimized cycling increases fire rate by 1.5/level.

fs-upgrade-l6-accuracy = Bipod
fs-upgrade-l6-accuracy-desc = Folding bipod tightens spread by 12° per level.

fs-upgrade-l6-mag-size = Extended Belt
fs-upgrade-l6-mag-size-desc = Larger ammo drum adds 50 rounds per level.

fs-upgrade-l6-reload-speed = Speed Belt
fs-upgrade-l6-reload-speed-desc = Quick-release mechanism reduces reload time by 20% per level.

fs-upgrade-l6-overclocked = Overclocked
fs-upgrade-l6-overclocked-desc = Sustained fire spools the barrel, ramping fire rate up to +1.2/level at full heat. The barrel glows red as it spools. Heat bleeds off when you stop firing.

fs-upgrade-l6-damage = Heavy Slug
fs-upgrade-l6-damage-desc = Dense subsonic rounds increase damage by 20% per level.

fs-upgrade-hydra-full-auto = Full Auto
fs-upgrade-hydra-full-auto-desc = Converts the drum to continuous-fire mode. Hold the trigger to keep it spinning.

fs-upgrade-hydra-fire-rate = Rapid Cycling
fs-upgrade-hydra-fire-rate-desc = Faster drum rotation increases fire rate by 0.5/level.

fs-upgrade-hydra-mag-size = Extended Drum
fs-upgrade-hydra-mag-size-desc = Expanded drum adds 2 grenade chambers per level.

fs-upgrade-hydra-reload-speed = Rapid Reload
fs-upgrade-hydra-reload-speed-desc = Streamlined loading cuts reload time by 20% per level.

fs-upgrade-hydra-barrage = Barrage Mode
fs-upgrade-hydra-barrage-desc = Sustained fire spools the launcher, ramping fire rate and explosive output up to maximum heat. Heat bleeds off when you stop firing.

fs-upgrade-rpg-reload-speed = Quick Load
fs-upgrade-rpg-reload-speed-desc = Practiced technique reduces reload time by 25% per level.

fs-upgrade-rpg-blast-radius = Blast Radius
fs-upgrade-rpg-blast-radius-desc = Larger warhead increases explosion radius by 2m per level.

fs-upgrade-rpg-armor-break = Armor Break
fs-upgrade-rpg-armor-break-desc = Explosive force damages armour integrity. Each level strips 25% of the target's maximum armour within the blast radius.

fs-upgrade-rpg-velocity = Rocket Velocity
fs-upgrade-rpg-velocity-desc = Higher-thrust propellant increases rocket travel speed significantly.

fs-upgrade-rpg-shaped-charge = Shaped Charge
fs-upgrade-rpg-shaped-charge-desc = Optimised warhead geometry concentrates the blast, dramatically raising peak damage at the point of impact.

fs-upgrade-tesla-charge-speed = Capacitor Boost
fs-upgrade-tesla-charge-speed-desc = Upgraded capacitors double recharge rate per level.

fs-upgrade-tesla-energy-capacity = Energy Cell Upgrade
fs-upgrade-tesla-energy-capacity-desc = Expanded power cell reduces energy cost per shot. +3-4 extra shots per level.

fs-upgrade-tesla-pull-strength = Graviton Core
fs-upgrade-tesla-pull-strength-desc = Graviton emitter creates a gravity well around the orb, pulling nearby enemies inward with increasing force per level.

fs-upgrade-tesla-arc-range = Extended Arc
fs-upgrade-tesla-arc-range-desc = Modified field emitter extends the range lightning chains from the orb by 2m per level.

fs-upgrade-tesla-fire-rate = Overcharged Coil
fs-upgrade-tesla-fire-rate-desc = Tuned discharge coil increases fire rate by 0.5/level.

fs-upgrade-minigun-fire-rate = Overclocked Barrel
fs-upgrade-minigun-fire-rate-desc = Tuned rotation motor increases fire rate by 1.5/level.

fs-upgrade-minigun-knockback = Knockback Rage
fs-upgrade-minigun-knockback-desc = Increased round velocity adds 10% knockback per level.

fs-upgrade-minigun-iron-beast = Iron Beast
fs-upgrade-minigun-iron-beast-desc = While firing at below 50% health, you take 20% less damage. Requires sustained fire to maintain.

fs-upgrade-minigun-damage = Depleted Core
fs-upgrade-minigun-damage-desc = Heavier core ammunition increases damage by 20% per level.

fs-upgrade-minigun-accuracy = Gyro Stabilizer
fs-upgrade-minigun-accuracy-desc = Active gyroscopic compensation tightens spread by 7° per level.

fs-upgrade-minigun-ammo-drum = Extended Drum
fs-upgrade-minigun-ammo-drum-desc = Larger rotating drum adds 250 rounds per level.

fs-upgrade-harvester-damage = Amplified Emitter
fs-upgrade-harvester-damage-desc = Boosts beam damage by 15% per level.

fs-upgrade-harvester-xray-conversion = X-Ray Conversion
fs-upgrade-harvester-xray-conversion-desc = Rebuilds the Harvester into an X-Ray Cannon. It still feeds research on every hit, hits far harder and fires through walls.

fs-upgrade-xray-self-charge = Resonant Cell
fs-upgrade-xray-self-charge-desc = Tuned resonator more than triples self-recharge rate per level.

fs-upgrade-xray-fire-rate = Pulse Accelerator
fs-upgrade-xray-fire-rate-desc = Faster charge cycling increases fire rate by 0.5/level.

fs-upgrade-xray-damage = Overloaded Emitter
fs-upgrade-xray-damage-desc = Higher energy output increases damage by 20% per level.

fs-upgrade-xray-pierce = Deep Penetration
fs-upgrade-xray-pierce-desc = Beam punches through additional targets per level.

fs-upgrade-xray-dot = Radiation Coating
fs-upgrade-xray-dot-desc = Irradiated targets emit radiation, taking ticking damage while marked. Duration and intensity scale per level.
